    "updated_at": "2023-09-10T07:48:59Z",
    "body": "We have coverage for `WebSocket` already, see https://wpt.fyi/results/html/infrastructure/urls/resolving-urls/query-encoding. Perhaps it should be moved out of that bigger test, but that's a separate task.",
